==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|vēsīca||bladder}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɛsɪkə/}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈviːsɪkə/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|vesicae}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A [[bladder]], especially the [[urinary bladder]] or the [[gall bladder]].
# {{lb|en|arts}} The [[vesica piscis]] or oval aureole in mediaeval painting.

